1923:Inc/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm4.h ****            The interrupt number can be positive to specify a device specific interrupt,
1924:Inc/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm4.h ****            or negative to specify a processor exception.
1925:Inc/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm4.h ****   \param [in]   IRQn      Interrupt number.
