  14:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  15:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  16:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  17:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Interrupts using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  18:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ===========================================================
  19:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  20:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to configure the NVIC interrupts (IRQ).
  21:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     The Cortex-M4 exceptions are managed by CMSIS functions.
  22:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  23:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the NVIC Priority Grouping using HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping() function
  24:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  25:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****      (#)  Configure the priority of the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority()
  26:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  27:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****      (#)  Enable the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ()
  28:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  29:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  30:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- When the NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0 is selected, IRQ pre-emption is no more possible.
  31:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****          The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the sub priority.
  32:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  33:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- IRQ priority order (sorted by highest to lowest priority):
  34:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest pre-emption priority
  35:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest sub priority
  36:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest hardware priority (IRQ number)
  37:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  38:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  39:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Systick using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  40:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ========================================================
  41:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  42:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     Setup SysTick Timer for time base 
  43:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****            
  44:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) The HAL_SYSTICK_Config()function calls the SysTick_Config() function which
  45:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        is a CMSIS function that:
  46:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Reload register with value passed as function parameter.
  47:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick IRQ priority to the lowest value (0x0FU).
  48:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Resets the SysTick Counter register.
  49:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Counter clock source to be Core Clock Source (HCLK).
  50:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Enables the SysTick Interrupt.
  51:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Starts the SysTick Counter.
  52:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****     
  53:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick Clock source to be HCLK_Div8 by calling the macro
  54:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG(SYSTICK_CLKSOURCE_HCLK_DIV8) just after the
  55:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function call. The __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG() macro is defined
  56:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        inside the stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.h file.
  57:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  58:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick IRQ priority by calling the
  59:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(SysTick_IRQn,...) function just after the HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  60:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        call. The HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() call the NVIC_SetPriority() function which is a CMSIS funct
  61:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccOMA1VY.s 			page 59


  62:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) To adjust the SysTick time base, use the following formula:
  63:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  64:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        Reload Value = SysTick Counter Clock (Hz) x  Desired Time base (s)
  65:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value is the parameter to be passed for HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  66:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value should not exceed 0xFFFFFF
  67:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
